flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Run pipeline_cli command]
    B --> C{Command type}

    C -->|bandpass| D{Phase}
    C -->|derive| D1[Alias to derive phase]
    C -->|audit| D2[Alias to audit phase]
    C -->|full| D3[Alias to derive and audit]
    C -->|preprocess| P0[Run preprocess driver directly]
    C -->|clustering| Q0[Run clustering driver directly]

    D1 --> MD[Mode derive only]
    D2 --> R
    D3 --> MF[Mode derive and audit]

    D -->|derive| MD
    D -->|audit| R
    D -->|derive and audit| MF

    MD --> E
    MF --> E

    subgraph PH1 [Phase 1 Derive]
      direction TB
      E[Load config and set overrides] --> E0[Resolve table selectors]
      E0 --> E1[Build or load row index cache]
      E1 --> E3[Iterative loop solve diagnose propose update]
      E3 --> E31[Bandpass solve with source stokes channel selection]
      E31 --> E32[Diagnostics V proxy and model residuals when available]
      E32 --> E33[Propose flags from metrics and thresholds]
      E33 --> E34{Dry run flag write}
      E34 -->|yes| E35[Keep pending flags in memory]
      E34 -->|no| E36[Write session flag table and version snapshot]
      E35 --> E4
      E36 --> E4

      E4{Convergence checks} --> C1
      C1[C1 unchanged cumulative flag set] --> S1{C1 true}
      S1 -->|yes| STOP1([Stop Phase 1 with C1])
      S1 -->|no| GATE

      GATE{Epsilon active and minimum iterations met} -->|no| NEXT1[Next iteration]
      GATE -->|yes| MSEL

      MSEL{Tracked metrics} -->|V metric| C3
      MSEL -->|Model metric| C4

      C3[C3 fractional V rms change below epsilon] --> COMB
      C4[C4 model residual convergence for RR and LL] --> C4A{Source model available}
      C4A -->|no| C4SKIP[C4 disabled for this run]
      C4A -->|yes| C4B[C4 requires all available model pols to converge]
      C4SKIP --> COMB
      C4B --> COMB

      COMB{Combine strategy} -->|any| ANYCHK[Any active epsilon criterion can stop]
      COMB -->|all| ALLCHK[All active epsilon criteria must stop]
      ANYCHK --> EPSSTOP{Epsilon convergence true}
      ALLCHK --> EPSSTOP
      EPSSTOP -->|yes| STOP2([Stop Phase 1 with epsilon])
      EPSSTOP -->|no| NEXT1
      NEXT1 --> E3

      STOP1 --> PH1OUT[Phase 1 outputs bandpass flags diagnostics]
      STOP2 --> PH1OUT
    end

    PH1OUT --> J{Selected mode}
    J -->|derive only| END1([End after Phase 1])
    J -->|derive and audit| R

    subgraph PH2 [Phase 2 Audit]
      direction TB
      R[Load saved bandpass and selected flags] --> R1[Run clustering detection]
      R1 --> R2{No dry run}
      R2 -->|no| R3[Plot only no clustering writes]
      R2 -->|yes| R4[Write clustering flags and version snapshot]
      R3 --> R5
      R4 --> R5

      R5{Refit enabled} -->|no| R6[After plots use saved phase 1 bandpass]
      R5 -->|yes| R7[Re solve bandpass with clustering flags]
      R7 --> R8{Write refit and not dry run}
      R8 -->|yes| R9[Persist refitted bandpass]
      R8 -->|no| R10[Use refit for after plots only]
      R9 --> R11[Generate before and after diagnostics]
      R10 --> R11
      R6 --> R11
    end

    P0 --> END2([End])
    Q0 --> END2
    R11 --> END2([End])
